  "articleBody": "Choose bathroom flooring by comparing water exposure, subfloor condition, comfort, maintenance, appearance, and installation complexity. Porcelain tile offers a durable, moisture-tolerant finish but requires careful substrate preparation and grout work; sheet vinyl or suitable luxury vinyl may install more simply, yet seams and edges still need careful detailing because the finished floor does not protect a damaged subfloor.",
